Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.02,0:01:20.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning and welcome to Mario Radio.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.05,0:01:21.26,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,562)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 13: {\fs80} We Picked Up Something Crazy!
Dialogue: 1,0:01:17.05,0:01:21.26,Title Part 4,Sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(648,562)\pos(139,880)\fs60}Episode 13: {\fs80} Picking Up Something Dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.28,0:01:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today we have a letter from\Nlanguishing lonesome boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.26,0:01:25.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kai, hear me out, he writes.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.10,0:01:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My girlfriend just ghosted\Nme and I'm super depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.30,0:01:33.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think I may have scared her off\Nwith my out of the blue proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.08,0:01:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I spent my whole paycheck on\Nher birthstone engagement ring too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.50,0:01:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So you managed to get the\Nbow and arrow back, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.38,0:01:48.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I found it in Akira's apartment.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.72,0:01:52.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He'd been using his stand to help\Nhimself to whatever he wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.56,0:01:56.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It all totaled up to be 500 million\Nyen, and the police are already on it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.60,0:02:00.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can try using your stand if you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.16,0:02:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but then I'd be forced to hunt\Nyou down and finish you off.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.18,0:02:06.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can't lay a finger\Non me while I'm in here!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.12,0:02:08.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chili Pepper has been retired.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.14,0:02:11.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even if he broke out,\NI doubt he'd attack us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.28,0:02:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Jotaro?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.52,0:02:17.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about the bow and arrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.88,0:02:21.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to the Speedwagon\NFoundation for analysis.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.28,0:02:25.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If things go the way I want, we'll\Nunlock the mystery of stands.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.34,0:02:26.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.25,0:02:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's fantastic!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.62,0:02:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After you're done, all\Nof this will be over!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.94,0:02:32.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It feels weird celebrating, but woohoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.30,0:02:33.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cracked the case!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.64,0:02:36.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're still questioning Otoishi\Nabout the other stand users.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.60,0:02:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way of knowing\Nhow many he awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.24,0:02:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll need to stay on your toes. Got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.30,0:02:46.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Japanese sure know\Nhow to make a cup of joe!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.22,0:02:48.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waitress!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.13,0:02:49.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Refill please! Careful!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.34,0:02:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pay attention!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.58,0:02:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, you're such a klutz.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.60,0:02:55.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't turn around for one second.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:01.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, it's almost time\Nfor the bus, isn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:04.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.65,0:03:05.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.57,0:03:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.44,0:03:09.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, get up. We gotta go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.86,0:03:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You think those two are going to be okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.12,0:03:19.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of worried.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.06,0:03:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Holy cannoli!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.36,0:03:24.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the yummiest\Ncake I've ever tasted!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.70,0:03:26.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Waitress, I want some more, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.30,0:03:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is Tomoko.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.66,0:03:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,May I ask who's speaking?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.72,0:03:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey, Mom. It's me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.88,0:03:40.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Josuke?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.79,0:03:41.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a surprise.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.00,0:03:43.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You never call the house.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.30,0:03:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you in some kind of trouble?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.02,0:03:47.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, uh, why would you think that?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.48,0:03:50.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, anyway, you're gonna be home\Nfor the rest of the day, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.48,0:03:51.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's the plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.22,0:03:53.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something I should know?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.60,0:03:54.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I just wanted to make sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.02,0:03:55.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.54,0:03:57.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.45,0:03:58.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in the world?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.42,0:04:01.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I swear, that kid had better\Nnot be up to anything fishy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.00,0:04:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.56,0:04:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope Mom doesn't think something's up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.32,0:04:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This'll be hard enough\Nwithout her catching on early.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.16,0:04:10.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.80,0:04:14.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I told that old geezer to\Nwait until I was off the phone
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.64,0:04:23.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait up
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.42,0:04:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear me?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.76,0:04:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I asked you to slow down old man
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.76,0:04:32.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that you weren't calling\Nafter me were you? Forget it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.84,0:04:35.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll never flag down\Na cab at this hour so
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.36,0:04:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're gonna have to\Ntake a bus to my house.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.44,0:04:39.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, one more thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.40,0:04:42.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this sounds kind of\Npushy, but it has to be said now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.62,0:04:47.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Make sure you keep your distance\Nfrom mom, and no talking to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.48,0:04:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Before we go anywhere, you have to\Npromise me the terms are non-negotiable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.82,0:04:55.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because if I know my mother, a\Nsimple visit won't be enough for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.14,0:04:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She'll become an emotional train wreck.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.74,0:05:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm well aware.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.92,0:05:03.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.40,0:05:05.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.31,0:05:09.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and so we're clear i'm\Nnot i'm gonna be calling
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.46,0:05:11.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you mr joestar the\Nentire time you're here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.90,0:05:18.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look this is awkward but i need to\Nbe as clear as possible strangers
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.64,0:05:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,that's all the two of us were till\Nnow i know that sounds kind of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.46,0:05:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,harsh but it's the truth like it\Nor not calling you my father just
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.72,0:05:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,isn't something i'm willing to do\Nhere's the deal after you see mom you
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.10,0:05:36.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,should hurry back to America.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.34,0:05:37.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.25,0:05:38.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.56,0:05:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I completely understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.74,0:05:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.56,0:05:44.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,trouble you. Shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.72,0:05:46.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think this could\Nbe any more awkward.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.82,0:05:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know the best thing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.62,0:05:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,would be to open up, but you can't\Nforce what isn't meant to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.66,0:05:56.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Mr. Josta - Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.20,0:06:05.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, by any chance, did a\Nbig grandpa-looking guy walk by?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.38,0:06:08.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He just got on that long-haul bus. Huh?
