Dialogue: 1,0:06:09.76,0:06:11.01,Episode 13 Typesetting 1b,Sign,0,0,0,,{\alpha80\be1\pos(1182,732)}Destination:\N Sapporo
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.88,0:06:12.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell were you thinking?!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.54,0:06:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the hassle.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.10,0:06:18.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said we were going to\Nget on a bus, so I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.86,0:06:21.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it would seem you caught\Nup not a minute too soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:25.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From the looks of things, we were\Njust about to merge onto the freeway.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.26,0:06:26.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm starting to think\NI should have let that
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:29.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,damn bus take you all the way to Hokkaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.26,0:06:31.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At least then I'd -\NOh, damn stomach cramp!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.96,0:06:34.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean to inconvenience you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.76,0:06:40.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.58,0:06:46.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sort of feels like something's pulling\Nat my pants leg. Yeah? Better be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.68,0:06:50.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If you drop your guard, it'll drag\Nyou off somewhere and eat you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.92,0:06:56.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.68,0:06:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.22,0:07:01.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here, we've got a stand user!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.42,0:07:04.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.32,0:07:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, there are two users.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.74,0:07:09.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And for the record, I'm talking about us.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.06,0:07:11.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm really thirsty.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,White a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.64,0:07:22.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These aren't footprints.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.02,0:07:23.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hands?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.28,0:07:25.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're handprints!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.00,0:07:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh my god!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.76,0:07:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stand just left, Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.78,0:07:36.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.72,0:07:37.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.78,0:07:39.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You can see it in the sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.42,0:07:43.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, there's no way in hell\NI'm letting him meet Mom now.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:46.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not when he's seeing and hearing things.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.40,0:07:49.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If it weren't for all this\Ndag-blasted concrete, I could find it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.86,0:07:50.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd it go?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.77,0:07:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.84,0:07:54.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you disappear? Come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.98,0:07:56.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.98,0:07:59.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This old man is nothing but trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.04,0:08:08.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hermit Purple!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.92,0:08:20.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Beat it, mutt! Go on!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.72,0:08:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shoo, shoo, get!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.98,0:08:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, uh, am I crazy or is that crying?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.44,0:08:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Over here, Josuke. Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.70,0:08:31.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.42,0:08:34.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm holding a tiny naked baby in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.22,0:08:37.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it sounds strange,\Nbut it's invisible. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.96,0:08:48.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's hard to believe, but you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.50,0:08:50.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can feel its soft skin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.64,0:08:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How is this even possible\Na bonafide invisible baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.64,0:08:58.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,From what I can tell it can't\Nbe any older than six months!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.52,0:09:02.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to know how it turned invisible in\Nthe first place and how to get out here?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.44,0:09:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm guessing it's the work of a stand but
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.60,0:09:08.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why on earth would an enemy\Nstand user turn a baby
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.36,0:09:11.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,invisible and where the\Nhell is this kid's mother?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.16,0:09:13.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing about this makes any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.42,0:09:20.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Josuke, call me crazy, but I\Nthink the baby is the stand user. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.86,0:09:23.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it just isn't aware\Nof its abilities yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.76,0:09:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whenever it was separated from its mother,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.74,0:09:29.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the poor little thing must have turned\Ninvisible based on pure instinct.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.02,0:09:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Duress in adults can trigger ulcers,\Nhair loss, and premature graying.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.92,0:09:39.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the case of this baby,\Nit's activated its stand powers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.18,0:09:43.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we can find its mother, I think\Nwe might be able to solve this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.00,0:09:45.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, freaking great!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.78,0:09:47.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, don't just stand there\Nand make it stop crying!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.02,0:09:50.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I, uh, don't exactly know how to do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.58,0:09:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a little bit of experience with\Nthis, but that was a long time ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.76,0:09:57.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, there, coochie-coochie-goo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.34,0:09:59.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, so that's where it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.26,0:10:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, is it a boy or a girl?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.24,0:10:04.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, this hand has never let me down.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.48,0:10:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cairo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.10,0:10:07.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.32,0:10:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm pleased to say, it's\Na girl! Oh, I get it!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.50,0:10:13.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's why you had to\Nuse your hand, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.24,0:10:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How else could you tell?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.80,0:10:16.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cairo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's something else\NI should know about?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.02,0:10:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.58,0:10:24.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have any tissues?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.62,0:10:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.20,0:10:28.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cairo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.00,0:10:30.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Th-that nauseating smell!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.16,0:10:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is it coming from your hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.12,0:10:34.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you saying she? Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.44,0:10:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had no idea she'd even done it\Nuntil I got a nose full of nasty,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.96,0:10:42.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I just finished scratching\Nmy beard with his hand!
