Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.62,0:10:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, I'm returning your manuscript.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.16,0:11:00.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm looking forward to the\Nrevisions on the second draft.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.14,0:11:00.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do your best.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.24,0:11:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're stuck with her for now,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.00,0:11:08.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so it looks like we'll need to\Npick up formula and diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.10,0:11:12.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since we don't want her going\Nau naturel, she needs some clothes.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.64,0:11:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm counting on you, Mr. Joestar. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.62,0:11:18.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You want me to buy everything?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.46,0:11:20.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I can't go in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.22,0:11:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have any idea how\Nthat would look to people?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.76,0:11:25.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody could walk by and\Ncatch me buying baby stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.94,0:11:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,People would start to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.44,0:11:32.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They'd see me as some stupid 16-year-old\Nbad boy who knocked up some poor chick.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.60,0:11:37.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, I see your point, but I only have\NAmerican Traveler's checks at the moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.44,0:11:39.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I have no choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.80,0:11:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Put whatever you buy on my card.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:43.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.10,0:11:46.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay away from all the expensive stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.84,0:11:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've worked my ass off to build\Nup that little nest egg, got it?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.26,0:11:51.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, yeah, I understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.88,0:11:54.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome, my good sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.72,0:11:57.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something I can\Nassist you with today?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.60,0:11:58.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Possibly.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.51,0:12:00.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you have disposable diapers here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:01.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You bet your bonnet we do.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.08,0:12:03.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this your first time?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.20,0:12:05.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.11,0:12:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yeah, I suppose it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.56,0:12:09.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These diapers are a cinch to change,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.76,0:12:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,even for customers able to live\Nat home without assistance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.66,0:12:14.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll rest well with these.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.56,0:12:16.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.47,0:12:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no, uh, the diapers aren't for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.62,0:12:20.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're for a baby I'm looking after.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.34,0:12:21.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodness!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.25,0:12:22.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry, how rude of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.82,0:12:24.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course they're for a baby.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.92,0:12:29.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First off, would you\Nlike traditional diapers?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.40,0:12:33.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or maybe training pads.\NHmm? Beg your pardon?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.36,0:12:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As you can see,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.62,0:12:36.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,although traditional\Ndiapers require a cover,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.88,0:12:40.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,they're far more economical and\Nless wasteful than training pads.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.98,0:12:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.26,0:12:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can I just have this one right here?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.20,0:12:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what size would you like?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.08,0:12:48.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.52,0:12:49.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How old is the baby, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.14,0:12:53.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Depending on your child's unique\Nshape, we have preemies, small,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.22,0:12:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,medium, large, and extra large.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.94,0:12:59.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And not to worry, we have diapers for\Nboys and girls, so you can't go wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.40,0:13:02.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my day, picking these\Nout was a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.04,0:13:03.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.95,0:13:06.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know that she's a girl,\Nand when I held her,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.24,0:13:08.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she was about this big,\Ngive or take an inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.52,0:13:09.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When you held her?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.68,0:13:11.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid I don't follow you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.44,0:13:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I don't want to run the risk of you\Nreturning ill-fitting soiled diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.34,0:13:18.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sure you can understand\Nthe problem with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.32,0:13:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, completely understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.02,0:13:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guess I'll grab every size you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.22,0:13:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In addition to that, I need baby wipes,\Ninstant formula, and baby bottles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:26.04,0:13:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then you are in luck.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.44,0:13:30.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We carry both glass and\Nplastic baby bottles.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.08,0:13:32.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glass bottles tend to be\Nscratch and odor-resistant,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.86,0:13:35.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but can be heavy for\Na baby's arms to hold.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.54,0:13:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Plastic bottles may be light, but\Nthey have a tendency to trap odors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.54,0:13:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Which of the two would you like today?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.16,0:13:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.72,0:13:46.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I'll take the one with...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.38,0:13:49.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also carry an assortment\Nof shapes and designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.12,0:13:51.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have rocket ships, racing cars, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.50,0:13:53.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, the baby can hold this one by itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.96,0:13:57.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when you turn this one upside down,\Nthe doll does a delightful little dance.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.00,0:13:59.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's so adorable.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.36,0:14:03.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't know, so would you mind\Npicking out a few and calling it a day?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.30,0:14:05.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you haven't seen our nipples.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.50,0:14:09.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rubber ones are soft and\Nsupple, but they lack durability.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.32,0:14:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Silicone nipples are resilient,\Nbut they tend to be so stiff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.12,0:14:14.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is our Cheap trainer.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.92,0:14:16.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's a diaphragm valve in the nipple.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:16.78,0:14:19.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And when it's coupled with the\Nbaby's own suckling pressure,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.48,0:14:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it regulates the flow of milk, so\Nthe little one gets the right amount.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.56,0:14:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the Nuke, a brand made in Germany.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.46,0:14:29.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's compressed into an oval so the nipple\Ncan mimic the mother's natural shape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.76,0:14:32.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And just as if the mother was\Nnursing the old-fashioned way,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.76,0:14:35.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the milk won't flow without\Nthe baby's jaw movement.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.16,0:14:36.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I'm sure they'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:37.14,0:14:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust your judgment on this stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.92,0:14:40.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.10,0:14:44.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We also carry nipple openings in the\Ncircular Y and cross-shaped varieties.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.34,0:14:47.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just give me everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.90,0:14:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And while you're at it, I need\Nsome baby clothes and socks, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.62,0:14:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, before I forget,\NI'll be paying by card.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.60,0:15:00.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.86,0:15:03.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,$136,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.94,0:15:07.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, what would the exchange\Nrate be in American dollars?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:07.18,0:15:08.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not mistaken,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.70,0:15:12.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you move the decimal point, or\Nrather, 100 yen is about 80 cents.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.90,0:15:19.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, in any case, it's all for a good\Ncause and it's just a bunch of baby stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.74,0:15:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.68,0:15:23.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How expensive could a couple\Nof Rugrat essentials be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.98,0:15:25.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the hold up?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.84,0:15:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's taking forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.52,0:15:28.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have all day...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.06,0:15:29.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.97,0:15:30.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.89,0:15:32.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What happened with the\Ngirl who got proposed to?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.14,0:15:35.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does no reply mean she's not\Ninterested or mulling things over?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.40,0:15:38.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take much more of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.48,0:15:42.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If someone from class sees me\Nhere, it's not gonna end well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.66,0:15:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry to keep you waiting, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.54,0:15:45.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here, thanks for the loan.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.04,0:15:46.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, great.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.95,0:15:49.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's get going\Nwhile the getting's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.78,0:15:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we don't have to worry about\Nlosing her but there's still a problem
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.86,0:16:01.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,without a face she's gonna freak\Nout everyone she comes in contact
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.36,0:16:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with I'm way ahead of you Josuke\NI picked out some makeup while I
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.66,0:16:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,was at that store First she needs\Na dab of foundation there and there
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.26,0:16:19.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,well what do you know she's actually\Npretty cute when you can see her?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.68,0:16:20.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, you're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.02,0:16:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A vision of beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.02,0:16:22.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.93,0:16:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This just made finding her\Nmother a hell of a lot easier.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.56,0:16:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We might actually pull this off.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.48,0:16:30.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Consider me impressed.\NNice one, Mr. Joestar.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.76,0:16:32.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm glad I could help out.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.34,0:16:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now then, it's time we put on\Nthe little lady's lipstick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.74,0:16:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A few strokes for her brows and\Nlashes, a little here, and...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.82,0:16:43.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why am I not surprised?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.78,0:16:46.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Toss a bit of flattery his way\Nin the old man's walking on air.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.04,0:16:51.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With your new makeover, we can walk\Naround without attracting any attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.32,0:16:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And since we can't exactly powder your\Neyes, sunglasses should do the trick.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.54,0:16:58.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now she's even cuter!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.62,0:17:00.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's some milk for her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.28,0:17:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm, do you think I went\Ntoo light on the foundation?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.26,0:17:07.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't seem to be sticking to her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.30,0:17:13.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, that's not it! What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.52,0:17:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's fading out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:17.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.95,0:17:19.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And my hands went with her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.72,0:17:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is horrible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.00,0:17:22.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can make other things invisible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.86,0:17:25.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means no solid\Nobject is safe from her!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.94,0:17:27.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What now? Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.10,0:17:28.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Joestar, drop the baby!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.66,0:17:29.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let go of it, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.96,0:17:32.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry before she turns the rest of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.80,0:17:34.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.71,0:17:36.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I let go, but they're still invisible!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.78,0:17:38.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think she's powering up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.04,0:17:55.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.60,0:17:58.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything that gets within\Na 30 centimeter radius of
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.06,0:18:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the baby is going to be\Nturned completely invisible.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.24,0:18:04.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,None of this is making any sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.78,0:18:07.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She can't be trying to protect\Nherself with her stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.46,0:18:09.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one could take care of her if she did.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.38,0:18:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something else must be going on here.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.36,0:18:14.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems like the effect\Nis triggered by anxiety.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.16,0:18:16.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stress is the culprit.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.04,0:18:20.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearly, she doesn't like to be\Nhandled by people she doesn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.24,0:18:23.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if she powers up any more, then\Nno one will be able to get near her.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.60,0:18:25.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll end up invisible, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.48,0:18:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, what a weird heap of junk.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.20,0:18:31.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone better pick that up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.86,0:18:33.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, not my problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.10,0:18:35.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Someone else can do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.24,0:18:37.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gah!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.15,0:18:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look out!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.22,0:18:43.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.84,0:18:45.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Somebody flicked a cigarette.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.34,0:18:47.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you can't see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.96,0:18:53.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell are you\Ndoing, Mr. Joestar? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.52,0:18:58.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Either get with the program,\Nold man, or get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.72,0:19:00.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I didn't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.32,0:19:01.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry for the trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.86,0:19:08.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The stroller outright vanished!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.24,0:19:11.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it took the ground with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.14,0:19:12.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was right, it is stress.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.00,0:19:15.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more she freaks out, the\Nstronger her invisibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.34,0:19:16.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the ability power gets!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.64,0:19:21.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me I didn't just hear\Nthe baby stroller flip over!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.24,0:19:28.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you for real?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.88,0:19:31.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The invisible baby just fell in the water?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.34,0:19:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.58,0:19:35.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, make some noise!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.20,0:19:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't see any bubbles! Is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.02,0:19:40.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Josuke, is there any sign of her? Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.20,0:19:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Every single horrible\Nthing that's happened to me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.62,0:19:47.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,today has been because of\Nthis doddering old has-been.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.56,0:19:50.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How the hell is this\Nirresponsible jackass my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.94,0:19:54.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A man so careless he\Nabandoned my mom for 16 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.90,0:19:58.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll never respect a\Nthoughtless bastard like him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.32,0:20:00.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way this was\Never gonna work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.26,0:20:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen, just stay out of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.06,0:20:11.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, she's gotta be\Naround here somewhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.16,0:20:14.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't care if you turn me invisible too.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.90,0:20:16.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just touch me! Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.46,0:20:18.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.98,0:20:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's not here!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.60,0:20:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.36,0:20:24.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Son of a...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:24.58,0:20:26.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How am I gonna find an invisible baby?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.12,0:20:30.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Especially when I'm waist\Ndeep in crystal clear water!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.88,0:20:33.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm truly sorry, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:34.34,0:20:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won't be able to hold out\Nlong, so I have a request.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.22,0:20:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell your mom hello.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.48,0:20:43.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'd mean the world if\Nyou gave her my message.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.48,0:20:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, I'm just a\Ntottering old man, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.42,0:20:54.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.66,0:20:59.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm giving the water\Na little bit of color.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.82,0:21:07.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, in the center.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.94,0:21:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.28,0:21:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The blood disappears towards the middle.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.54,0:21:13.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's where the baby is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.44,0:21:14.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take care of her, Josuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.82,0:21:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mr. Joestar...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.14,0:21:31.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No regular person would even\Nattempt what you've just done.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.24,0:21:35.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not for a stranger's kid\Nthey'd only met that day.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.72,0:21:38.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.48,0:21:44.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I just wanted to look cool for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.36,0:21:47.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, did it work?
