Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.48,0:22:04.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that was an experience\NI'll never forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.92,0:22:07.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, all's well that\Nends well, I suppose.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.50,0:22:17.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,136,000 yen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.32,0:22:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My hard-earned money!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.82,0:22:19.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.02,0:22:21.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You gray-haired dude!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:22.32,0:22:24.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I did this! Huh?
Dialogue: 1,0:22:51.43,0:22:53.81,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Any time I need to see your face, I just close my eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.46,0:22:53.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anytime I need to see your\Nface, it has closed my eyes.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:53.81,0:22:56.06,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And I am taken to a place where your crystal mind
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.02,0:22:56.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I am taking two bits\Nwith a crystal mind.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:56.06,0:22:58.85,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And magenta feelings take up shelter in the base of my spine
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.26,0:22:57.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A magenta feeling.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.44,0:22:58.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take a shelter in the face of my spine.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:58.85,0:23:00.52,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Sweet like a chic-a-cherry cola
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.04,0:23:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straight like a chicken cherry cola.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.44,0:23:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't need to try to explain!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:00.52,0:23:02.90,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}I don't need to try to explain, I just hold on tight
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.88,0:23:02.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just hold on tight.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:02.90,0:23:05.28,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}And if it happens again, I might move so slightly
Dialogue: 0,0:23:03.04,0:23:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And if it happens again,\NI'ma move so slightly?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:05.28,0:23:08.07,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}To the arms and the lips and the face of the human cannonball
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.36,0:23:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the arms and the lips and the face.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.00,0:23:08.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To the human kind of all that I need to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:08.07,0:23:09.78,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}That I need to, I want to
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.00,0:23:09.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I want to.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:09.78,0:23:12.03,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Come stand a little bit closer
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.91,0:23:11.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come and stand a little bit closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.82,0:23:14.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Breathe in and get a bit higher.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:12.03,0:23:14.37,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Breathe in and get a bit higher
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:16.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll never know what hit you!
Dialogue: 1,0:23:14.37,0:23:15.99,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}You'll never know what hit you
Dialogue: 1,0:23:15.99,0:23:18.62,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}When I get to you
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.18,0:23:18.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I get to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.54,0:23:22.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you, but?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:18.62,0:23:23.13,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.06,0:23:25.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got to find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:23.13,0:23:26.67,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I'd die to find out
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.38,0:23:31.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I want you, I don't\Nknow if I need you, but?
Dialogue: 1,0:23:27.67,0:23:32.14,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I want you, I don't know if I need you, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.04,0:23:35.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I got to find out.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:32.14,0:23:35.51,ED Lyrics,,0,0,0,,{\fad(100,100)}Ooh, I would die to find out
